%% title: `atm list`
%% summary: Bounded metadata-only mailbox query.
%% commentary: This path queries bounded mailbox metadata rows from SQLite, joins immutable message rows with unified mutable state, excludes deleted and expired rows, then collapses logical-current rows in ATM before returning list output.
%% sets: cli
flowchart TD
    A[atm list request] --> B[Daemon list handler]
    B --> C1["SQL: query_mailbox_metadata_rows
LEFT JOIN mail_messages + mail_message_states
filter team/agent
exclude deleted_at
exclude expired expires_at
ORDER BY newest first
LIMIT bounded row set"]
    C1 -->|sql error| E1[Typed MailboxReadFailed or MailboxLockTimeout]
    C1 --> C2["ATM selection and collapse
classify unread/pending/history
collapse logical-current thread view
apply sender/task/since/contains filters
compute bucket counts in ATM"]
    C2 --> O1[Return bounded list rows plus counts]
    B -. forbidden .-> F1[inbox JSON or summary file read]
